WEBVTT

00:04:59.076 --> 00:05:02.436
And I believe we find power
through the idea of me

00:05:02.476 --> 00:05:04.116
and the idea of we.

00:05:04.156 --> 00:05:07.316
And so we need to go through
our own process as women of color

00:05:07.356 --> 00:05:10.396
to figure out what are narratives
that we've been taught or told

00:05:10.436 --> 00:05:13.556
or ideas that we've been taught
or told that we need to undo.

00:05:13.596 --> 00:05:14.756
I call that shedding.

00:05:14.796 --> 00:05:17.916
Like, how do we get rid of those messages
that we're not powerful,

00:05:17.916 --> 00:05:20.076
that we're not leaders,
that we're not enough?

00:05:20.116 --> 00:05:22.236
How do we replace them
with healthy messages?

00:05:22.276 --> 00:05:23.756
That's again, the power of me,

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:27.396
what you need to do for yourself to find
your internal and individual power.

00:05:27.396 --> 00:05:30.116
But then once you find it,
you need to find your sisters.